		<h1 id="sigma">Deep Owl</h1>
		<p>(Deepwoken) Log or run away. Since the Deep Owl can be seen before it is physically spawned, as signified by the falling feathers, it is almost guaranteed the player can get away by turning back and returning the way they came. (This strategy wont work if the owl spawns on-top of the player or if the Owl is standing somewhere and is already aggressive after killing an enemy.)</p>
		<p>You really only need to parry to fight the owl. will take a little getting used to though</p>
